        "Content": "REA Dooley Group are offering For Sale this residential site located in the heart of Milford village. \n\nThe site extends to 0.29 acre / 0.12 hectare and is being sold with full planning permission Ref 22/04741, for a detached bungalow extending to 113.60 sqm / 1,223 sqft). **The planning permission is due to expire in early 2027 and is currently restricted to a local applicant**\n\nMains services and electricity are available at the roadside. \n\nThe site is adjacent to all amenities of Milford village and is within easy commute of Dromcollogher, Charleville, Kanturk, Newmarket and Newcastle West and Mallow towns. \n\nMap availa\n\nDirections\nNearest Eircode P56 RK74\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
